 sooner had...than'' for repeated event.","points":1},{"id":5324,"question":"No sooner ______ he sat down ______ the doorbell rang.","options":["had, than","did, when","has, than","was, when"],"answer":"had, than","explanation":"''No sooner had...than'' for interrupted relaxation.","points":1},{"id":5325,"question":"No sooner ______ we sat down to eat ______ the baby started crying.","options":["had, than","did, when","has, than","was, when"],"answer":"had, than","explanation":"''No sooner had...than'' for unexpected interruption.","points":1},{"id":5326,"question":"______ you study hard, you will fail.","options":["If, not","Unless","Although","Because"],"answer":"Unless","explanation":"''Unless'' means ''if not''.","points":1},{"id":5327,"question":"If you ______ hurry, we will miss the bus.","options":["don''t","won''t","didn''t","isn''t"],"answer":"don''t","explanation":"First conditional: ''if + present tense''.","points":1},{"id":5328,"question":"______ it rains, we will stay home.","options":["If","Unless","Although","Because"],"answer":"If","explanation":"''If'' for conditional clauses.","points":1},{"id":5329,"question":"You won''t pass ______ you study.","options":["unless","if","although","because"],"answer":"unless","explanation":"''Unless'' for negative condition.","points":1},{"id":5330,"question":"If I ______ you, I would apologize.","options":["were","was","am","will be"],"answer":"were","explanation":"Second conditional: ''if + were'' for hypothetical.","points":1},{"id":5331,"question":"______ you don''t practice, you won''t improve.","options":["If","Unless","Although","Because"],"answer":"If","explanation":"''If'' with negative for condition.","points":1},{"id":5332,"question":"I won''t go ______ you come with me.","options":["unless","if","although","because"],"answer":"unless","explanation":"''Unless'' for condition of accompaniment.","points":1},{"id":5333,"question":"If it ______ sunny tomorrow, we will go to the beach.","options":["is","will be","was","would be"],"answer":"is","explanation":"First conditional: present tense in ''if'' clause.","points":1},{"id":5334,"question":"You will fail ______ you don''t study.","options":["if","unless","although","because"],"answer":"if","explanation":"''If'' with negative for negative outcome.","points":1},{"id":5335,"question":"______ you hurry, you will be late.","options":["If, don''t","Unless","Although","Because"],"answer":"Unless","explanation":"''Unless you hurry'' means ''if you don''t hurry''.","points":1},{"id":5336,"question":"If she ______ here, I would tell her.","options":["were","was","is","will be"],"answer":"were","explanation":"Second conditional with ''were'' for hypothetical.","points":1},{"id":5337,"question":"I won''t be angry ______ you tell the truth.","options":["unless","if","although","because"],"answer":"unless","explanation":"''Unless'' for condition of truth-telling.","points":1},{"id":5338,"question":"If you heat water to 100°C, it ______.","options":["boils","will boil","is boiling","boiled"],"answer":"boils","explanation":"Zero conditional: general truths use present tense.","points":1},{"id":5339,"question":"______ you don''t eat, you will be hungry.","options":["If","Unless","Although","Because"],"answer":"If","explanation":"''If'' with negative for hunger condition.","points":1},{"id":5340,"question":"You can''t enter ______ you have a ticket.","options":["unless","if","although","because"],"answer":"unless","explanation":"''Unless'' for entry requirement.","points":1},{"id":5341,"question":"How ______ water do you drink?","options":["much","many","a lot","few"],"answer":"much","explanation":"''Much'' is used with uncountable nouns.","points":1},{"id":5342,"question":"How ______ books do you have?","options":["much","many","a lot","little"],"answer":"many","explanation":"''Many'' is used with countable nouns.","points":1},{"id":5343,"question":"There isn''t ______ milk left.","options":["much","many","a lot","few"],"answer":"mu