"],"answer":"a lot of","explanation":"''A lot of'' with countable noun ''students''.","points":1},{"id":5354,"question":"He drank ______ water after the run.","options":["much","many","a lot of","few"],"answer":"a lot of","explanation":"''A lot of'' with uncountable noun ''water''.","points":1},{"id":5355,"question":"She doesn''t have ______ patience.","options":["much","many","a lot of","few"],"answer":"much","explanation":"''Much'' with uncountable noun ''patience''.","points":1},{"id":5356,"question":"I saw ______ elephant at the zoo.","options":["a","an","the","no article"],"answer":"an","explanation":"''An'' before vowel sounds.","points":1},{"id":5357,"question":"She is ______ honest person.","options":["a","an","the","no article"],"answer":"an","explanation":"''An'' before silent ''h'' in ''honest''.","points":1},{"id":5358,"question":"Please pass me ______ salt.","options":["a","an","the","no article"],"answer":"the","explanation":"''The'' for specific, known items.","points":1},{"id":5359,"question":"He is ______ best student in the class.","options":["a","an","the","no article"],"answer":"the","explanation":"''The'' with superlative adjectives.","points":1},{"id":5360,"question":"I need ______ umbrella; it''s raining.","options":["a","an","the","no article"],"answer":"an","explanation":"''An'' before vowel sounds.","points":1},{"id":5361,"question":"She plays ______ piano very well.","options":["a","an","the","no article"],"answer":"the","explanation":"''The'' with musical instruments.","points":1},{"id":5362,"question":"We go to ______ school every day.","options":["a","an","the","no article"],"answer":"no article","explanation":"No article with ''go to school'' (general activity).","points":1},{"id":5363,"question":"He bought ______ new car yesterday.","options":["a","an","the","no article"],"answer":"a","explanation":"''A'' before consonant sounds.","points":1},{"id":5364,"question":"The sun rises in ______ east.","options":["a","an","the","no article"]